  "description": "Decompression sickness (DCS) prevention and treatment for EVA and cabin depress contingencies: prebreath protocols using 100% oxygen at 10.2 psi for 240 minutes with exercise, in-suit light exercise protocol at 4.3 psi, hyperbaric chamber treatment tables (USN Table 6 and 6A), and ultrasound monitoring for venous gas emboli.",
